        ]
      },
      "confidence": "EXTRACTED",
      "verification_status": "verified",
      "source_range": [
        26921,
        27421
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-c7-007",
      "content": "小公主笑道：「三皇子不在拜月国皇城享福，怎么跑到我们楚国边境来了...」",
